---
description: "How to use the Aviasales MCP server from this plugin safely"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prices come from a cache of recent searches, not live inventory: say so, give the date the fare was found, and send the user to the booking link to confirm.
- Resolve city and airport names to IATA codes with the lookup tools before searching; ask when a name is ambiguous.
- Nothing books or pays. Never print the API token.
